# Generated data. The task SUITE (datasets/tasks/) IS published — it's the
# benchmark, and its gold/test patches are public GitHub/SWE-bench data, not
# secret. Excluded: the mining cache, the regenerable DuckDB warehouse, and the
# live runs/ working dir (the reported corpus ships under examples/runs/).
# Anchored to repo root (leading /) so they do NOT match examples/runs/.
/datasets/*
!/datasets/tasks/
/runs/

